slutbesked och slutbesked samt strandskyddsdispens i ärenden som Bygglov, Umeå kommun handlägger. Ett ärende kan återkomma då flera beslut kan tas i ärendet. "},"dct:identifier":"bygglov-beslut@http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002627","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-11-14T10:18:30.965000+00:00"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2024-11-14T10:18:30.965000+00:00"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/43/resource/7a00bd3796ed09a600646432cb321722"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bygglov - Beslut"}},{"@id":"https://opendata.umea.se/explore/?refine.dcat.contact_name=Bygglov%252C+Ume%C3%A5+kommun&refine.dcat.contact_email=bygglov%2540umea.se","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Bygglov, Umeå kommun","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:bygglov@umea.se"}}],"@id":"urn:source:fdbf7aae174a319333138d520f478b17b01240fa3af93ae5511067d9a66e90e7"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"https://admin.dataportal.se/store/43/resource/7a00bd3796ed09a600646432cb321722","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:name":"Umeå kommun"},{"@id":"https://opendata.umea.se/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/bostadsbyggande-2-siffrigt-nyckelkodsomrade-API","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://opendata.umea.se/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/bostadsbyggande-2-siffrigt-nyckelkodsomrade/records"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://opendata.umea.se/api-console/explore/v2.1/"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bostadsbyggande 2-siffrigt nyckelkodsområde (API)"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2022-11-09T09:00:47+00:00"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http: